  zone Orgrimmar
  only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock
  tip Train your new spells.
  train class

step Ratchet
  only Shaman
  zone The Barrens
  tip Fly to Ratchet. Islen Waterseer camps on the coast a short walk south of the town.
  fly "Ratchet"
