step Brazier of Everfount
  only Shaman
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip Do your shopping in the Undercity first, then fly to the Sepulcher. The Brazier of Everfount stands on the hill just south-west of it: beat the Corrupt Manifestation of Water beside it, place its bracers in the brazier, speak to the Minor Manifestation of Water and keep the Shard of Water for Islen. Fly on to Tarren Mill from the Sepulcher.
  fly "The Sepulcher"
  collect 7812 quest 63.1
  turnin 63                           -- Brazier of Everfount
  accept 100
  turnin 100                          -- Minor Manifestation of Water
  accept 96                           -- for Islen Waterseer: from Stranglethorn, next guide

