# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Strahnbrad

step Gol'dir
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Head north past Valik's camp to Strahnbrad, the Syndicate-held village (35-37). Jailor Borhuin carries the Rusted Iron Key; Gol'dir sits in a cage in the house on the north side.
  tip Careful: Stealthed Syndicate spies roam Strahnbrad, and the buildings hold many Syndicate mobs, mages among them.
  collect 3704 quest 503.1            -- Inside
  turnin 503                          -- Gol'dir, on the top floor
  accept 506

